msgstr ""
"Finally, please note that this migration is **a delicate operation**. The"
" YunoHost team did its best to review and test it, but the migration "
"might still break parts of the system or its apps.\n"
"\n"
"Therefore, it is recommended to:\n"
"    - **Perform backups** of any critical data or app. More info on "
"https://doc.yunohost.org/backup;\n"
"    - **Be patient** after launching the migration: depending on your "
"Internet connection and hardware, it might take up to an hour for "
"everything to upgrade properly;\n"
"    - **Reach the community** on the forum if you need help "
"troubleshooting issues."

