"that port 80 (and 443) <a "
"href='https://doc.yunohost.org/admin/get_started/post_install/dns_config/'>are"
" not correctly forwarded to your server</a>.<br>2. On more complex "
"setups: make sure that no firewall or reverse-proxy is interfering."

