"href='https://doc.yunohost.org/admin/get_started/post_install/dns_config/'>are"
" not correctly forwarded to your server</a>.<br>2. You should also make "
"sure that the service nginx is running<br>3. On more complex setups: make"
" sure that no firewall or reverse-proxy is interfering."

